    "testimonial_GzLmQJ": {
      "type": "testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "item_LhJUhT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Created has been a game changer for our business. We've been able to reimagine the world of creative merchandise by partnering with them. The only thing better than the quality of their products is the A+ customer service their team provides.</p>",
            "name": "Portrait Coffee",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/testimonial-2.jpg"
          }
        },
        "item_n4kEwE": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>These guys have set the bar for excellent service and products in the specialty coffee industry. Not just drinkware, but any of my vendors.</p>",
            "name": "Bear Coast Coffee",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/testimonial-1.jpg"
          }
        },
        "item_a3zRGN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our mugs from Created have been the perfect fit for Huckleberry. They make that morning cup of coffee a little more bright and colorful. It's the perfect way to start your day!</p>",
            "name": "Huckleberry Roasters",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/testimonial-3.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_LhJUhT",
        "item_n4kEwE",
        "item_a3zRGN"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "What our customers say"
      }
    },
